Date: Sat, 4 Jul 2026 16:58:02 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Neko LineageOS: [Anti Detection] Add service to filter app
 list & Spoof install source & Allow MicroG Signature Spoof in user build

Nowadays even Google [discourages aggressive applist reading](https://developer.android.com/training/package-visibility)
many apps still let their risk control works based on applist reading, this feature allows user to block Lineage App visibility

Also some apps refuse to work when installed from non-Play-store source (e.g. Aurora), makeing it very unfriendly for
Aurora store and MicroG users

Also for some reason LineageOS official make MicroG Signature Spoof not working in user build work (maybe to not make Google angry)

